[Description]
{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Fennario;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\hyphpar0\sl288\slmult1\cf1\f0\fs18 You lived along the Blueshoal river as a hermit the last ten years. You made your living wandering from village to village, helping the locals find lost animals, catch fish, and celebrate feasts. One day, however, a village asked you to recover a herd of cows that was swimming across the river. You used your magic to summon a gentle wave to bring them ashore, but Allah must have been displeased with you, for instead a great kraken of a wave formed and roiled down the river. You were arrested and tried for the destruction of three foot bridges. Fortuntely, the local atabeg remembered you from the war you helped him win twenty years ago, and let you off with a stern warning. 
\par \pard\cf0\f1\fs20 
\par }


